# 🚀 Featured Projects

## 🦂 Team Scorpions — Hybrid Token-Efficient Routing Agent

**AMD Developer Hackathon — ACT II 2026**

A local-first AI routing system designed to reduce unnecessary cloud inference by intelligently routing requests between local and cloud models.

### Key Features

* 🧠 Intelligent AI routing
* ⚡ Local-first inference
* 💰 Token and cloud-cost optimization
* 🚀 FastAPI backend
* 🐳 Docker deployment
* 🔄 Retry and fallback mechanisms
* 📊 Confidence-based routing
* 🧪 Extensive automated testing

### Technologies

`Python` `FastAPI` `Docker` `LLM` `AI Routing` `Local Inference`

🔗 **Repository:**
https://github.com/Awais-0806/Team-Scorpians-Routing-Agent

---

## ⚡ Zero-Token Enterprise Router

An enterprise-focused AI routing architecture designed around **local inference, intelligent request handling, performance, observability, and cloud-cost reduction**.

### Technologies

`Python` `FastAPI` `Streamlit` `SQLite` `Redis` `Docker` `Prometheus`

### Focus Areas

* Local-first AI inference
* Intelligent model routing
* Enterprise API architecture
* Cost optimization
* Monitoring and analytics
* Containerized deployment

🔗 **Repository:**
https://github.com/Awais-0806/zero-token-enterprise-router

