# 🧪 Security Engineering Mindset

I approach security projects with a practical engineering workflow:

```text
Understand the System
        ↓
Map the Attack Surface
        ↓
Identify Potential Weaknesses
        ↓
Validate Findings
        ↓
Automate Detection
        ↓
Implement Mitigation
        ↓
Test & Monitor
        ↓
Continuously Improve
```

My goal is not only to identify vulnerabilities, but also to understand **why they occur, how they can be detected, and how systems can be made more resilient**.

